{
  "project": {
    "name": "Circuit / Breadboard Trainer",
    "slug": "circuit-trainer",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "engine": "cadquery",
    "description": {
      "en": "Oversized, tactile circuit-teaching hardware on the universal 2.54 mm (0.1 in) breadboard pitch — big enough for small hands and group demonstration. Build a solderless-breadboard base board with a grid of lead holes and a DIP gutter, an oversized component holder with lead legs an integer number of pitches apart, or a power-rail bus strip.\n\nOfficial Visualizer and Configurator: Yantra4D",
      "es": "Hardware táctil sobredimensionado para enseñar circuitos sobre el paso universal de protoboard de 2.54 mm (0.1 in) — suficientemente grande para manos pequeñas y demostración grupal. Genera una placa base tipo protoboard con rejilla de orificios para patillas y un canal DIP, un soporte de componente sobredimensionado con patillas separadas un número entero de pasos, o una tira de riel de alimentación.\n\nVisualizador y configurador oficial: Yantra4D"
    },
    "thumbnail": "/projects/circuit-trainer.webp",
    "difficulty": "beginner",
